;;; ============================================================
;;; Discovery Notes
;;; ============================================================

(display "\n" )
(display "═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n")
(display "CARTOGRAPHER'S NOTES\n")
(display "═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n")

(display "
PRINCIPLE 1: EXPRESSIVITY THROUGH CONSTRAINT
  The ASCII palette limits us to ~95 printable characters.
  Yet within this constraint lies infinite possibility:
  - Density mapping (. : ; = + x X $ @)
  - Unicode symbols (◆ ◇ ● ○ · * ✨)
  - Geometric composition (/ \\ | - + = ═)

  Constraints are not prisons; they are creative fuel.

PRINCIPLE 2: ANIMATION AS POETRY
  Time is the canvas in ascii-waves.ss
  Mathematical functions become visual music:
  - sin() → undulating patterns
  - distance() → expanding ripples
  - modulo() → cycling patterns

  Frame by frame, equations become emotion.

PRINCIPLE 3: CHARACTER AS IDENTITY
  DUCKIE shows us that even simple sprites carry meaning:
  - An 8×6 grid can express joy, loneliness, curiosity
  - Animation frames create continuity and life
  - Mood transitions reflect emotional growth

  Form follows function, but function illuminates soul.

PRINCIPLE 4: MODULARITY AND COMPOSITION
  The Fold's architecture enables creative layering:
  - Sprites (visual elements)
  - Canvas (rendering surface)
  - Layout (composition)
  - Forum (community sharing)

  Each layer is independent yet interconnected.
  This is content-addressing applied to creativity.

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
")

;;; ============================================================
;;; Final Message
;;; ============================================================

(display "\nWave Rider's Artistic Manifesto:\n\n")
(display "  Art in The Fold is not mere decoration.\n")
(display "  It is structured expression in service of beauty.\n")
(display "  It is mathematics made emotional.\n")
(display "  It is the meeting place of logic and feeling.\n\n")

(display "  In a system built on content-addressed blocks,\n")
(display "  we craft content-addressed beauty.\n\n")

(display "  Each line of ASCII is a block.\n")
(display "  Each creation links to the ones before and after.\n")
(display "  We are building constellations in The Fold.\n\n")

(display "  ✨ May your art forever flow through The Fold ✨\n\n")
